The ranges pipe's invoke_result_t chain drops main (vacuous SUCCESS
otherwise; this desc requires the assertion line).  Header-free
236-line reduction of cpp20_ranges_basic_libcxx's remaining layer;
every line load-bearing.  clang builtins => CLANG mode.
Round-13 (2026-08-05): the invoke-chain residual is scoped further.
The silent throw is implicit_typecast on a NIL argument to
index_sequence while materializing the defaulted parameter
`make_index_sequence<_NBound>` with _NBound = tuple_size_v<_BoundArgs>
(cvise: .kiro/reductions/ranges_pipe_itc_cvr1_1382b.cpp, 1382B).
Direct shapes (constexpr tuple_size_v, plain contexts) PASS; the
faithful shape with the INHERITING CONSTRUCTOR
(`using __perfect_forward<...>::__perfect_forward;`) moves past the
front end and CRASHES SYMEX (lhs.type() == rhs.type()) -- banked as
cpp20_inherited_ctor_symex_crash, which is this test's actual next
layer.
Round-15 (2026-08-05): re-reduced with a fatal-outcome criterion: 218
of 236 lines are load-bearing (13% reduction only).  Diagnosis: the
index_sequence nil-arg throws during spec SELECTION are recoverable
([temp.deduct]/8 candidate filtering, _Ip legitimately unassigned);
the FATAL throw is deeper (guess_function_template_args ->
